i Heretic', 'Soldevi Sage', 'Soldevi Sentry', 'Soldevi Steam Beast', 'Soldier of Fortune', 'Spiny Starfish', 'Splintering Wind', 'Stench of Decay', 'Storm Cauldron', 'Storm Crow', 'Storm Elemental', 'Storm Shaman', 'Stromgald Spy', 'Suffocation', 'Surge of Strength', 'Sustaining Spirit', 'Swamp Mosquito', 'Sworn Defender', 'Taste of Paradise', 'Thawing Glaciers', 'Thought Lash', 'Tidal Control', 'Tornado', 'Undergrowth', 'Unlikely Alliance', "Urza's Engine", "Varchild's Crusader", "Varchild's War-Riders", "Veteran's Voice", 'Viscerid Armor', 'Viscerid Drone', 'Wandering Mage', 'Whip Vine', 'Whirling Catapult', 'Wild Aesthir', "Winter's Night", 'Yavimaya Ancients', 'Yavimaya Ants']
